24
00:01:55,324 --> 00:01:56,908
<i>[efecto sonoro de suspenso]</i>

25
00:01:56,908 --> 00:01:59,286
<i>[puerta cruje]</i>

26
00:01:59,286 --> 00:02:03,290
<i>♪ ♪</i>

27
00:02:03,290 --> 00:02:06,251
<i>[efecto sonoro dramático]</i>

28
00:02:06,251 --> 00:02:12,799
